title nav content by dynamic_finder.php: the list tabs. OemrUI adds the margins and
search-row icons to the right of it. The page-length menu, search, Filter and Add
Patient sit on their own line below, in finder.html.twig.

@package   OpenEMR
@link      https://www.open-emr.org
@author    David Eschelbacher <psoas@tampabay.rr.com>
